  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A creature with one of your Bardic Inspiration dice can expend it when dealing damage with a weapon attack, dealing an additional amount of damage equal to the die result added to the weapon's damage. Additionally, when a living creature that has your Bardic Inspiration die is reduced to 0 hit points, it can expend that die as a reaction to be reduced to a number of hit points equal to a roll of the Bardic Inspiration die instead.</p>",
